{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_host_import_policy</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek-vulkan","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Sarek_vulkan","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Vulkan_host_import_policy","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Policy for importing host memory into a Vulkan device (Sarek #503).</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-decision\"><a href=\"#type-decision\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> decision</span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-decision.Allowed\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-decision.Allowed\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Allowed</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-decision.Not_opted_in\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-decision.Not_opted_in\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Not_opted_in</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Default: the caller did not set <a href=\"#val-opt_in_variable\"><code>opt_in_variable</code></a>.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-decision.Amdgpu_refused\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-decision.Amdgpu_refused\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Amdgpu_refused</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Opted in, but the device is an AMD driver (kernel oops, #503).</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-opt_in_variable\"><a href=\"#val-opt_in_variable\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> opt_in_variable : string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>SPOC_VULKAN_HOST_IMPORT</code>: set to <code>1</code> to allow the import.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-amdgpu_override_variable\"><a href=\"#val-amdgpu_override_variable\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> amdgpu_override_variable : string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Set to <code>1</code> together with <a href=\"#val-opt_in_variable\"><code>opt_in_variable</code></a> to allow the import on AMD drivers anyway. For disposable sessions only.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_amd\"><a href=\"#val-is_amd\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_amd : <span><span class=\"label\">vendor_id</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">driver_id</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>PCI vendor 0x1002, or Vulkan driver ID AMD proprietary / open source / RADV.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-decide\"><a href=\"#val-decide\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> decide : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">opted_in</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">amdgpu_override</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">vendor_id</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">driver_id</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"#type-decision\">decision</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Pure decision.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-of_environment\"><a href=\"#val-of_environment\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> of_environment : <span><span class=\"label\">vendor_id</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">driver_id</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-decision\">decision</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><a href=\"#val-decide\"><code>decide</code></a> with the two switches read from the environment (<code>1</code> enables).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-refusal_reason\"><a href=\"#val-refusal_reason\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> refusal_reason : <span><a href=\"#type-decision\">decision</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The message of the refusal, <code>None</code> when <a href=\"#type-decision.Allowed\"><code>Allowed</code></a>.</p></div></div>"}